+  // THE EOF SPAN ENDS AT THE LAST LEXEME, NOT AT THE SCANNER'S CONSUMED POSITION.
+  // `final_state.pos` is where the scanner STOPPED, which includes everything it read without
+  // emitting a lexeme: the `//` arm advances past a whole comment line (01_tokenize.dag:97-104,
+  // no token), and the newline arm's token spans the newline itself. So stamping EOF at the
+  // consumed position sends an author into trivia. Measured at the head, a file whose last content
